  m_Name: Notes from a scientist (part 3)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fullText: '"Day 6" There is no doubt about it. Scans of ???''s interior have shown
    a complex electronic system that could not be achieved by us. We are trying to
    decrypt the data it holds, but our excitement has slowed down progress. We believe
    this might hold information related to a species from another planet, and likely
    has a message for us. There is still a lot of work to do before we can share
    our discoveries.'
